                <li><strong>Single-Leg Romanian Deadlift:</strong> Hinge at hip with opposite hand holding DB. <em>3 × 8–10 / leg.</em></li>
                <li><strong>Side Plank Clamshells:</strong> Strengthens gluteus medius to stop hip drop. <em>3 × 15 / side.</em></li>
            </ul>
